{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《Grand 住去首爾》最新預告曝光，主持周嘉洛及朱敏瀚終於同韓國天王金鍾國同框！兩人化身小粉絲，在健身房見到偶像時竟忍不住瘋狂喪摸對方肌肉，場面極度搞笑。金鍾國更即場展示超強腹肌，但畫面竟被打格，究竟發生咩事？\n</p>\n<h2>周嘉洛朱敏瀚Gym房朝聖 瘋狂喪摸金鍾國爆肌</h2>\n<p>在最新曝光的片段中，周嘉洛及朱敏瀚齊齊現身 gym room，準備與韓國頂流爆肌代表金鍾國大鬥「男子力」。當見到偶像真人時，兩位香港大隻仔代表即時表現得非常雀躍，與金鍾國打招呼時更忍不住「係咁摸係咁摸」，完全將粉絲心態表露無遺，場面相當搞笑。這次難得的機會，讓兩位主持興奮之情溢於言表，完全忘記了鏡頭的存在，與偶像的互動自然又有趣。</p>\n<h2>金鍾國展現實力者本色 邊做Gym邊飆高音腹肌竟被打格</h2>\n<p>出名是「能力者」兼唱功了得的金鍾國，在節目中亦毫不吝嗇，即席示範邊做 gym 邊氣定神閒大展歌喉的獨門絕技，讓在場的周嘉洛及朱敏瀚嘆為觀止。為了滿足觀眾，金鍾國更應要求大晒超強腹肌。不過，製作組在預告片中卻為「金腹肌」打上厚格，吊足觀眾胃口，令一眾粉絲心癢難耐，想一睹金鍾國真正的「腹肌實力」，就要密切留意節目正式播出。</p>\n<h2>網民熱話「金城安遇上Gym鍾國」 半日吸逾7,500 Likes</h2>\n<p>金鍾國與「金城安」周嘉洛的歷史性同框，隨即引爆網民熱烈討論，有網民更以「金城安遇上 Gym 鍾國」為題分享消息，帖文在短短半日內已狂吸超過 7,500 個 Likes，可見期待值極高！網民紛紛留言洗版：「初初仲以為剪接/AI」、「我連節目名都未知就已經好想睇」、「還我遮咗嘅腹肌」、「呢個聯動勁有趣」、「我老公（周嘉洛）同金鍾國做 gym」、「會唔會有 Running Man Grand 住番外篇」、「能力者！」、「香港大隻仔 S VS 韓國大隻仔」、「竟然係真」、「OMG OMG OMG」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_10719975536ae17b1b8a423.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_10719975536ae17b1b8a423.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_6458924256ae17b1f0ad5c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_6458924256ae17b1f0ad5c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_20604282716ae17b119aacd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_20604282716ae17b119aacd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_14519907666ae17b15301ff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_14519907666ae17b15301ff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_9681691356ae17b1880b0a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_9681691356ae17b1880b0a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_16957288186ae17b3c5e73a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/16_16957288186ae17b3c5e73a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_20793380366ae17b439c9e9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/18_20793380366ae17b439c9e9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_13928562046ae17b476621f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/19_13928562046ae17b476621f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_16373899806ae17b4b57a02.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"grand住去首爾 金鍾國 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20_16373899806ae17b4b57a02.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:41:45.556875+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1084,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:20:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:38:34.315572+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:38:34.315572+00:00","content_hash":"f66d7004c429cab9dda5b1b652d76cd9fca3d2f5b5093e9384a4c4ba7bf563ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}